&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#ffffff;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#ffffff;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#ffffff;background-color:#f2f2f2;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:10.5pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-6pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:6pt;"&gt;・ジェイテクトグループBCP基本方針を策定&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:10.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-6pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:6pt;"&gt;・防災訓練、減災啓発、製品供給の早期復旧に向けた準備等の実施&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:17.9pt;min-height:17.9pt;"&gt;
